{
  "format_version": 1,
  "name": "LeanForward",
  "description": "A small forward pipeline: frame setup, background, depth pyramid, unlit geometry, FXAA, post-processing. Teaches how a pipeline is just passes chained in execution order, and which stage does what. Compare with the shipped Forward pipeline, which also holds every installed plugin's passes.",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "kind": "core.on_frame_start",
      "params": {},
      "position": [
        0.0,
        120.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "frame",
      "kind": "helio.frame.setup",
      "params": {
        "model": "forward",
        "reactive_mask": false
      },
      "position": [
        300.0,
        120.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "background",
      "kind": "helio.pass.background",
      "params": {},
      "position": [
        600.0,
        120.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hiz",
      "kind": "helio.pass.hiz",
      "params": {},
      "position": [
        900.0,
        120.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "unlit",
      "kind": "helio.pass.unlit",
      "params": {},
      "position": [
        1200.0,
        120.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fxaa",
      "kind": "helio.pass.fxaa",
      "params": {},
      "position": [
        1500.0,
        120.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "post_process",
      "kind": "helio.pass.post_process",
      "params": {},
      "position": [
        1800.0,
        120.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "output",
      "kind": "core.output",
      "params": {},
      "position": [
        2100.0,
        120.0
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": [
    {
      "from": {
        "node": "start",
        "pin": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "node": "frame",
        "pin": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "node": "frame",
        "pin": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "node": "background",
        "pin": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "node": "background",
        "pin": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "node": "hiz",
        "pin": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "node": "hiz",
        "pin": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "node": "unlit",
        "pin": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "node": "unlit",
        "pin": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "node": "fxaa",
        "pin": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "node": "fxaa",
        "pin": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "node": "post_process",
        "pin": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "node": "post_process",
        "pin": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "node": "output",
        "pin": "in"
      }
    }
  ],
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "note1",
      "text": "Frame setup: names the lighting model (forward) and so the draw phases the frame runs. Every pipeline needs one near the start.",
      "position": [
        280.0,
        -80.0
      ],
      "size": [
        320.0,
        160.0
      ],
      "color": [
        0.2,
        0.4,
        0.7,
        0.25
      ],
      "nodes": [
        "frame"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "note2",
      "text": "Scene: the background (sky), the depth pyramid used for visibility, then the geometry pass.",
      "position": [
        580.0,
        -80.0
      ],
      "size": [
        920.0,
        160.0
      ],
      "color": [
        0.2,
        0.4,
        0.7,
        0.25
      ],
      "nodes": [
        "background",
        "hiz",
        "unlit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "note3",
      "text": "Image: FXAA smooths edges, then post-processing (tone mapping and the like) produces the final colour.",
      "position": [
        1480.0,
        -80.0
      ],
      "size": [
        620.0,
        160.0
      ],
      "color": [
        0.2,
        0.4,
        0.7,
        0.25
      ],
      "nodes": [
